# card_rank_match_count
# Feature description: The number of ranks that are the same across the five cards. This feature aids in identifying pairs, two pairs, three of a kind, full house, and four of a kind combinations.
# Usefulness: Directly contributes to better predictive power for combinations requiring rank matches (Target=1, 2, 3, 6, 7).

