# Feature name: rank_sum_normalized_sine
# Feature description: The sine of the normalized rank sum (rank_sum divided by the number of cards in the hand).
# Usefulness: Introduces non-linearity to the rank_sum_normalized feature, which might help in capturing patterns in the target classes by emphasizing specific normalized values of rank sums.
