o of card_suit_match_count to card_rank_match_count.\\n# Usefulness: Evaluates the relative importance of suit similarity versus rank similarity in identifying specific hands (e.g., Flush vs. Four of a Kind), improving model interpretability and sensitivity.\\ndf[\'suit_match_to_rank_match_ratio\'] = df[\'card_suit_match_count\'] / (df[\'card_rank_match_count\'] + 1e-6)  # Adding epsilon to avoid division by zero"]': 4.878001190200543e-06}]
