tion: The normalized card_suit_match_count feature divided by the normalized card_rank_match_count feature.\n# Usefulness: Provides insight into the relative balance between suit similarity and rank similarity, helping to classify hands like Flush (Target=5) versus rank-based hands like Full House (Target=6) or Four of a Kind (Target=7).\ndf['suit_and_rank_flatness'] = df['normalized_card_suit_match_count'] / (df['card_rank_match_count'] / 5 + 1e-6)  # Normalize card_rank_match_count by max(5) to match scaling"]
