te cards reliant on overlapping characteristics, such as Flush (Target=5), Full House (Target=6), \n# and Straight Flush (Target=8). This interaction adds deeper feature complexity without adding many columns.\n\ndf['combined_feature_ratio'] = (\n    (df['card_suit_match_count'] * df['card_rank_match_count']) /\n    (df['rank_sum'] + 1e-6)  # Avoid division by zero\n)"]
